            },
            "reviewBody": "Well, I revised the recipe alot, so I'm not sure it's fair to rate this one. But what I came up with is REALLY yummy. I used 2 bananas, 1 6 oz vanilla yogurt, 1 6oz strawberry yogurt, 2 teaspoons banana extract, 3/4cup white milk and 3/4cup Nestle choc milk. YUM!!",
            "datePublished": "2008-06-15T04:41:07.997Z"
